      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 minute</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You know how you can briefly slip into the spiritual realm to interface with ghosts. For the duration, you and all your equipment gain the ghost-touch property, allowing you and incorporeal creatures to interact physically and block each other’s spaces. When you Seek, you also have a +2 circumstance bonus to tell if an object is inhabited by an incorporeal creature.</span></p>",
